Gerald works at a daycare that pays him $30 every day. He worked for an entire week and saved a total of $100. How much did he spend?,Gerald works at a daycare that pays him $30 every day. He worked for an entire week and spent a total of $100. How much does he have left?,110,110,110,110,"Gerald works 7 days in a week, earning $30 each day.  
