Now, adding both their cookies together. Greta has 30, Celinda has 60. So total cookies baked would be 30 plus 60. Let me add those: 30 + 60 equals 90. So together, they have 90 cookies before any are eaten.

Then, the problem says they eat 10 cookies while they're cooling. So I need to subtract those 10 eaten cookies from the total. Taking 90 minus 10. That would be 80. So after eating, there are 80 cookies left. Those are the ones they put in the box.

