Now, the remaining shells after the Alphas took their share would be 700 minus 280. Let me subtract that: 700 - 280 = 420. So there are 420 shells left after the Alphas. 

Next, The Finders found 60% of the remaining shells. The remaining shells after Alphas are 420, so 60% of that. Let me calculate 60% of 420. 60% is 0.6, so 420 * 0.6 = 252. So The Finders found 252 shells. 

